        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "May 13, 2025",
            "id": "18807a75-af82-42c8-b386-3165aedbf1b9",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thanks for staying with us at this rental Dwayne. Your 5-star rating is truly appreciated! We always aim for all our guests to have a 5-star experience with us and we are happy that this was achieved with your stay. We do hope we can welcome you again soon for an even better vacation experience which we know we can provide.\n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Great",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Family Stay",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Megan P.",
        "date": "2025-03-15T07:16:00Z",
        "id": "67d6c763c3461a629495016b",
        "label": "Good",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Mar 19, 2025",
            "id": "b828e65e-1f39-484e-ac7b-243d05482934",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you for your feedback! We are so glad to hear that the house was a great fit for your family and that you found it comfortable and spacious. We sincerely apologize for the issue with the hot tub, especially since it was an important part of your stay. We completely understand your disappointment and regret that it was not operational during your visit. Your feedback is valuable, and we will ensure better communication regarding amenities in the future. We appreciate you staying with us and hope to have the opportunity to host you again.\n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nThe house was a great fit for our large family, it was comfortable and had plenty of space. We were pretty disappointed that the hot tub never worked. We were staying during a cold weekend and were excited to be able to use the hot tub. Part of why we booked this house was knowing it had a hot tub. If it wasn’t going to work they should have disclosed that. Everything else was great.",
        "title": "Great house, broken hot tub"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brittany P.",
        "date": "2025-07-28T20:44:33Z",
        "id": "6887f0239ddf4b33fc0edb2c",
        "label": "Poor",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 4,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Aug 12, 2025",
            "id": "0296a2bf-182e-4851-aca1-17efcf589578",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for taking the time to share your feedback, Brittany. We are glad to hear you enjoyed the location, easy check-in process, and that the kitchen was well stocked for your stay. We also appreciate you noting the quick delivery of fresh linens once we were made aware of the issue.\n\nWe sincerely apologize for the inconvenience regarding the pool. We understand how disappointing this must have been, especially for the children in your group. We agree that it would have been best for this to be disclosed ahead of time, and we will review our listing to ensure it reflects the most accurate and up-to-date information.\n\nYour feedback about the rusted outdoor furniture has also been noted, and we’ll work with the owner to address this concern promptly.\n\nWe value your comments as they help us improve both our communication and guest experience, and we regret that your stay did not meet expectations in this regard.\n\nThank you again for your feedback, and we hope you might consider giving us another opportunity to provide you with a better experience in the future.\n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Checkin was easy, location was perfect. Kitchen was stocked. You could walk to multiple places to eat/shop/gas station. Private boardwalk down to the beach.The bed linens for 3 beds were stained- one was crusted stained like it hadn’t been washed. New linens were delivered within an hour or so. The pool DOES NOT WORK. Has not worked since at least March 2025 when another review mentioned the same thing. I was told by someone from the property management company that the owner has been contacted multiple times about it with no response so apparently the owner doesn’t care. The listing is misleading on that alone. I contacted the property management company multiple times about the pool and kept being told “they’re trying to contact the owner” and “my complaint is being documented” and “we’ll give you a call back”. They never once called back. I never got any answers. I was sent a link to let them know how my stay went, and only then when I laid it all out was I “compensated” (within an hour or so of sending what I had to say, funny enough). We were compensated MAYBE 5% of what we paid in total.Metal table and chair on the main level deck are rusted and falling apart. The location was the best part about the house. The house was large enough to accommodate our large group. It’s the lack of care/communication over the pool issue that I had the biggest problem with. The pool not working should have been disclosed. We had a few small children that were looking forward to it.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Check-in, location",
          "Disliked: Communication"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
